ETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수강신청대상자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수강신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이수 시 혜택 등을 안내하고자 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font face=\"휴먼명조\">◆ </font>산학융합 교육과정이란</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">우리대학의 창의적 산학연구중심</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(R&amp;BD) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">특성화에 부합하는 교육을 수행