le=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수강대상</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">전체 학부(과) 재학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">(산학융합 교육과정 참여학부에 한해서 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">전공 및 전문교양 교과목 인정)</span><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font face=\"휴먼명조\">◆ </font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수강신청 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">별도의 학생선발 및 신청서 접수 절차는 없으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">[</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학부수강신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">] </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">바로가기 서비스 이용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font face=\"휴먼명조\">◆ </font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이수 시 혜택</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">창의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">융합</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">전공 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">개영역에서 각각 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">개 교과목 이상을 이수하고 현장실습 교과목을 이수한 경우 산학융합 교육과정을 이수한 것으로 인정하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이수증을 교부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">계획</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">하여 재학생들의 취업 및 역량강화에 혜택을 주고자 한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">- 산학협력단장 -</span></strong></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">문의 산학교육운영팀 054)478-6731</span></strong></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\